  "description": {
   "en": "An anthology story that depicts the sexuality of women in their 30s in a realistic way!\n\nStory 1: Two People Living Alone: Sano Mikako is 35 years old and single. She hasn't had a boyfriend for 10 years. Many of her coworkers are married, but she's not desperate to meet someone new. She's not particularly interested in marriage or children, and she can live alone… Then, a frivolous salesman, Hashimoto, appears before her. Mikako becomes interested in him when he proclaims “Dying alone is just fine.”, but…!?"
  },
